# Build context for the repo root: `docker build -f examples/host/Dockerfile.pinocchio .`
# and `docker compose --profile plan build planner`.
#
# The Pinocchio image clones its own sources and copies nothing from here, so the
# context only needs to be small, not complete.
.git
.rebot-venv
.uv-cache
.uv-python
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
examples/edge-rust/target
examples/edge-rust/dist
examples/host/capture/captures
examples/host/capture/calib
examples/host/capture/tls
examples/host/capture/work
examples/host/capture/out
examples/host/capture/tags
examples/host/capture/.selftest-work
manuals/assets
